{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "放在模型外",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 96.08,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "回到持有钱包的智能体。",
   "spoken": "回到持有钱包的智能体。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.24,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.626
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "防线不能放在模型里，模型理解指令的方式不可靠。",
   "spoken": "防线不能放在模型里，模型理解指令的方式不可靠。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 4.06,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 4.154,
   "speechEnd": 8.171
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "要在钱包这一层，用代码限制它。",
   "spoken": "要在钱包这一层，用代码限制它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 8.6,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 8.6,
   "speechEnd": 11.184
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "第一，额度，单笔和单日上限写在钱包工具或合约里，超额要人工确认。",
   "spoken": "第一，额度，单笔和单日上限写在钱包工具或合约里，超额要人工确认。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 11.62,
   "dur": 7.6,
   "speechStart": 11.713,
   "speechEnd": 18.976
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "第二，白名单，只允许向预设的地址和合约转账或授权。",
   "spoken": "第二，白名单，只允许向预设的地址和合约转账或授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 19.44,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 19.544,
   "speechEnd": 24.668
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "第三，权限隔离，智能体用独立的低额度钱包，主资产不交给它。",
   "spoken": "第三，权限隔离，智能体用独立的低额度钱包，主资产不交给它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 25.1,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 25.1,
   "speechEnd": 31.108
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "第四，人工确认，新地址、授权、大额操作走人工审批，界面显示解码后的交易。",
   "spoken": "第四，人工确认，新地址、授权、大额操作走人工审批，界面显示解码后的交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 31.56,
   "dur": 8.32,
   "speechStart": 31.658,
   "speechEnd": 39.623
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "第五，输入隔离，一个模型的输出，不能直接成为另一个智能体的指令。",
   "spoken": "第五，输入隔离，一个模型的输出，不能直接成为另一个智能体的指令。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 40.1,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 40.1,
   "speechEnd": 45.878
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "记忆写入要校验来源，转账前从链上读取余额，运维面板按特权系统加固。",
   "spoken": "记忆写入要较验来源，转账前从链上读取余额，运维面板按特权系统加固。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 46.32,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 46.32,
   "speechEnd": 54.228
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "给外部内容打上不可信标记，有用，但不够，模型仍可能照做。",
   "spoken": "给外部内容打上不可信标记，有用，但不够，模型仍可能照做。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 54.7,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 54.7,
   "speechEnd": 60.433
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "团队里，AI 写的代码和配置，和人写的一样，走审查、测试和审计。",
   "spoken": "团队里，AI 写的代码和配置，和人写的一样，走审查、测试和审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 60.84,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 60.84,
   "speechEnd": 66.904
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "作为用户，不要把主钱包交给任何 AI 机器人，要用，就给它一个只放少量资金的独立钱包。",
   "spoken": "作为用户，不要把主钱包交给任何 AI 机器人，要用，就给它一个只放少量资金的独立钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 67.3,
   "dur": 8.4,
   "speechStart": 67.3,
   "speechEnd": 75.468
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-12.wav",
   "start": 75.92,
   "dur": 1.36,
   "speechStart": 75.92,
   "speechEnd": 77.122
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "写在提示词里的规则，会被说服绕过。",
   "spoken": "写在提示词里的规则，会被说服绕过。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-13.wav",
   "start": 77.5,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 77.5,
   "speechEnd": 80.927
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-14",
   "text": "写在合约里的规则不会，合约按代码拒绝这笔转账，模型说什么都没用。",
   "spoken": "写在合约里的规则不会，合约按代码拒绝这笔转账，模型说什么都没用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-14.wav",
   "start": 81.32,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 81.32,
   "speechEnd": 87.359
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-15",
   "text": "安全边界，要放在模型之外。",
   "spoken": "安全边界，要放在模型之外。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-15.wav",
   "start": 87.78,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 87.876,
   "speechEnd": 90.322
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-16",
   "text": "下一集讲审计、测试与开发流程。",
   "spoken": "下一集讲审计、测试与开发流程。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-16.wav",
